readregister? <la>,<reg> [,<"OFF/ON">]
  Note: The flag "ON" or "OFF" (default = "OFF")
        gives more information on the individual
        fields of the register. Valid registers
        are all even numbers between 0 and 62
        and register names: A24PL, A24PH, A32PL,
        A32PH, ATTR, DHIG, DLOW, DTYP, ICON, ID,
        IST, OFFS, PROT, RESP, SNL, SNH, STAT,
